msgctxt "80"
msgid "Hey, are you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Kiryu-san!? Is that really you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "It's me! You know me! Geez, I haven't seen you in ages!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Remember? I'm Minamizawa, from the Mars Fighters! We got outta that mess "
"together two years ago, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "It was your mess to begin with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Hey, don't just shut me down! At least do it with a solid comeback, would "
"ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Like, \"You two were the ones who messed with me!\" Get some wordplay in "
"there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Well, you haven't changed much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Anyway, I heard you've been missing for about half a year."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Where'd ya hear that...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"I ran into Kitagawa earlier. You've got him worried. He's been looking for "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Hey, hold on a sec. Is that true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Once Kitagawa heard Minamizawa was in Kamurocho, he dropped "
"everything and came straight here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Hey, Minamizawa, buddy... You probably oughta head back, huh? Sounds like "
"Kitagawa's worried sick about ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"That's right, man. You don't have to be stubborn. Just go find your friend, "
"apologize, and get back to being a team."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Get off my back! I'm... I'm Minamizawa, the Mars Fighter!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Why should I apologize to my equal, my partner, just 'cause we ain't a team "
"anymore!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Besides... now that I'm gone, Kitagawa's doin' better than ever..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Even if I went back, there's no way our old agency would let us get back "
"together. I'd just be draggin' him down..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Man..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"(It's clear Kitagawa wants to do manzai with Minamizawa. Maybe I'll give "
"him a call...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Hey, hold it! Kiryu-san, you're not gonna call Kitagawa, are ya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "That's what I promised him. Now that I've found you, I have to let him know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "I can't let you do that! Man, I... I can't face him right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Fine... if you're so set on calling him, I guess I got no choice. Sorry, "
"Kiryu-san, but it's time for a real punchline!"
msgstr ""

